Z07-P20 | Reporting Illegal, Unmarked or Out-of-Season Gear via TIP | New manuscript (Z07 P18 authority referral)
objective: Report suspected unlawful, park-located, or out-of-season trapping hardware safely to Minnesota DNR enforcement.
applies: Discovering suspected illegal traps, snares, or wildlife violations.
equipment: GPS/phone camera from safe distance, MN DNR TIP 1-800-652-9093.
diagram: Keep safe distance without touching | Log exact GPS and distant photo | Call MN DNR TIP promptly
visual: Conceptual three-tier reporting ladder escalating suspected unlawful gear to Minnesota DNR TIP without disturbing evidence.
action: Do not touch, dismantle, or relocate suspected illegal traps or snares; leave the scene intact for Conservation Officers while marking a safe mental/GPS landmark so others avoid it. @L09
